---
layout: base.njk
---
{#
	About page (GLOSSARY: the collective's identity page).

	The page carries its biography and its team list as two language versions:
	`es` is always present, `en` is optional. The divider between them is drawn
	here by the shared `divider` macro, never stored in the content — the
	biographies first, then the team lists, each Spanish version before its
	English one.

	Each team list stays one rich-text field so editors keep free-form control
	over names, roles and the former-collaborators heading, in that language
	only.
#}
{%- from "partials/divider.njk" import divider -%}
<article class="about">
	<div class="about-main">
		<div class="about-bio">{{ es.bio | md | safe }}{% if en and en.bio and en.bio | trim %}{{ divider() }}
{{ en.bio | md | safe }}{% endif %}</div>
		<div class="about-team">{{ es.team | md | safe }}{% if en and en.team and en.team | trim %}{{ divider() }}
{{ en.team | md | safe }}{% endif %}</div>
	</div>
</article>
